{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11205090","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11205090","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1120509001:1":{"text":"わぁ、お嬢ちゃん。随分強そうなのを連れてるじゃない！町が大騒ぎになったでしょ！？","source_cn":"呀，小丫头，你身后跟着的这大家伙，够壮实！镇上的骚动肯...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x731182DA9EB89E85","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1120509002:1":{"text":"いくらで買ったの？高かったでしょ？聞いた話じゃ、<style=\"highlight\">競売会</style>ではぼったくりが横行しているそうじゃない。","source_cn":"你花了多少钱才拿下它？估计不便宜吧，听说那<style...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDCE792D926871A83","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1120509003:1":{"text":"けい……ばい？","source_cn":"拍……买……会？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBF2262670D611622","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1120509004:1":{"text":"知らないの？なら、聞かなかったことにして。","source_cn":"不知道？那就别在意，当我没说。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC8F9050B4E9E6B76","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1120509005:1":{"text":"それより、うちの獣皮を見ていってちょうだいよ！この二日で仕入れたものばかりだし、品質は間違いないよ！","source_cn":"还是来看看我家的兽皮吧！都是我这两天新收的，质量绝对没的说！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB75F5D7B4E2072DA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1120509006:1":{"text":"その、長毛のをください！アンお姉ちゃんは確か……うん、テントと同じくらい大きいのを五十枚！","source_cn":"要，长毛的！安丹姐说……嗯，要帐篷那么大，五十张！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB26E7E0AA9E6E0D2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1120509007:1":{"text":"結構な量ね、店の在庫を確かめてみるわ。","source_cn":"这量可不小啊，等我算算店里这些够不够。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x19B590FD427BB628","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1120509008:1":{"text":"あなたたち運がいいわよ！でも、この五十枚を売ったら、店に数枚しか残らなくなっちゃうけどね。","source_cn":"哟，正正好！卖完你这五十张，我这儿就只剩几张边角料了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x80DF6619C0C8898E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1120509009:1":{"text":"ちょっと待ってよ……これだけの量だから九割引きにして……合計で二百金貨！現金でいい？それとも何か担保に入れる？","source_cn":"让我算一下总价……嗯，你要了这么多，打个九折再抹零……...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8159F405DE38A99A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:11:1120509009":{"text":"ちょっと待ってよ……これだけの量だから九割引きにして……合計で二百金貨！現金でいい？それとも何か担保に入れる？","source_cn":"让我算一下总价……嗯，你要了这么多，打个九折再抹零……就这个数吧，两百枚金币！现金还是拿东西抵押？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8159F405DE38A99A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1120509010:2":{"text":"確かに、毛皮一枚に四金貨はちょっと……","source_cn":"就是啊，一张毛皮居然要四枚金币……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x231BF59EE6AD33AC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1120509013:1":{"text":"ねぇ、あなたたちに目利きができるの？こんな丈夫な獣皮が四金貨なんて格安だよ。","source_cn":"唉，一看你们就不识货。这么结实的兽皮，卖四金币都算便宜的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x554FDDA51FEB3CB9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1120509014:1":{"text":"それに、払うのはあなたたちじゃなくて、あの女の子でしょ？この値段なら損することはないよ！","source_cn":"再说了，又不是你们付钱，小丫头还在算呢。这价格，你们不吃亏！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFEB4F9A2A8B0B035","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1120509015:1":{"text":"アンお姉ちゃんから四百金貨もらった……それで買うものは二つ……四百の半分は……","source_cn":"唔，安丹姐给了四百，要买两样东西……四百的一半是两百……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDC7EF603C89ED5A5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1120509016:1":{"text":"ちょうど半分だから二百だ！これで買えるよね！","source_cn":"两百，刚好一半！可以买！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB60B583C935EF181","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","d